# Sprynk

Sprynk is a modern travel planning platform that helps users organize, plan, and manage trips from start to finish.

Unlike traditional travel planners, Sprynk combines trip organization, budgeting, itineraries, reservations, packing lists, and intelligent planning tools into a single experience. AI is designed to enhance the planning process—not replace it.

## Vision

Create the easiest and most enjoyable way to plan a trip.

## Status

🚧 Currently under development.
